OL,3,APolice investigate unknown substance
OL,4,Athat caused Manchester's Co-Op Live
OL,5,Aevacuation
OL,6,
OL,7,FThousands of people were evacuated from
OL,8,Fa concert in Manchester after an
OL,9,F"unknown substance" was released into
OL,10,Fthe crowd.
OL,12,FIt happened towards the end of US
OL,13,Frapper Don Toliver's show at the Co-op
OL,14,FLive arena at about 22:00 GMT on
OL,15,FSunday, with music fans describing a
OL,16,F"horrible smell" and people
OL,17,F"screaming".
OL,19,FOne person was taken to hospital while
OL,20,Fmore than 80 people were assessed for
OL,21,F"eye and respiratory symptoms", the
OL,22,FNorth West Ambulance Service said.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
