OL,3,APolice investigate unknown substance
OL,4,Athat caused Manchester's Co-Op Live
OL,5,Aevacuation
OL,6,
OL,7,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said a
OL,8,Fmajor incident was declared after
OL,9,Freports of people suffering from the
OL,10,Feffects of an unknown substance, which
OL,11,Fpolice initially believed to be tear
OL,12,Fgas.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
