OL,3,ACan AI spot breast cancer earlier? NHS
OL,4,Alaunches world's largest trial to find
OL,5,Aout
OL,6,
OL,7,FNearly 700,000 women across the UK are
OL,8,Fto be invited to join the world's
OL,9,Flargest trial of how artificial
OL,10,Fintelligence can help in breast cancer
OL,11,Fscreening.
OL,13,FAI will be used to review mammograms to
OL,14,Fsee if it can improve early cancer
OL,15,Fdetection and ease the workload of
OL,16,Fclinical staff, while not
OL,17,Fover-diagnosing women unnecessarily.
OL,19,FRecruitment to the EDITH trial has
OL,20,Falready begun at Cambridge University
OL,21,FHospitals, the first of 30 sites across
OL,22,Fthe UK.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
