OL,3,AFive takeaways from the failed climate
OL,4,Atalks COP31
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe COP31 summit in Turkey came as
OL,7,Fevidence of climate change could not
OL,8,Fhave been clearer - 2026 bought glacier
OL,9,Fcollapses, record European heat, and
OL,10,Fwildfires across Asia - but also when
OL,11,Fgeopolitical divisions could not have
OL,12,Fbeen deeper.
OL,14,FThe result was the longest-running
OL,15,Fclimate talks in UN history failed to
OL,16,Fdeliver on its central political
OL,17,Fagreement ` the Antalya Pacts - to
OL,18,Ffurther climate action.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
