OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFive takeaways from the failed climate
OL,4,Atalks COP31
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite two countries, Australia and
OL,7,FTurkey, leading the charge in their
OL,8,Fjoint hosting of the negotiations, they
OL,9,Fcould not bring the nations together.
OL,11,FAfter a dramatic and fractious final
OL,12,Fday where countries walked out over the
OL,13,Fabsence of mention of fossil fuels in
OL,14,Fthe text and money issues, questions
OL,15,Fare being asked more loudly than ever
OL,16,Fbefore about whether the COP process
OL,17,Fcan still deliver.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
