OL,3,ABoy, 7, pulled alive from rubble hours
OL,4,Aafter Russian strike on Ukraine,
OL,5,Arescuers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FA seven-year-old boy has been rescued
OL,8,Ffrom the rubble of a residential
OL,9,Fbuilding in Dymer, in the Kyiv region,
OL,10,Fafter 14 hours. Overnight Russian
OL,11,Fstrikes on the village killed 11
OL,12,Fpeople, Ukrainian officials have said.
OL,14,FThe attack occurred in the early hours
OL,15,Fof Sunday. A 79-year-old woman was also
OL,16,Frescued alive from the collapsed
OL,17,Fbuilding, Kyiv's regional head Tymur
OL,18,FTkachenko said.
OL,20,FA strike on a private home in Bila
OL,21,FTserkva killed one more person and set
OL,22,Fthe building ablaze, he added.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
