OL,3,ARussian warship hit by Ukrainian drones
OL,4,Ain Libya, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian warship was sunk by Ukrainian
OL,7,Fdrones at a port in Libya on Sunday,
OL,8,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky said.
OL,10,FOn Sunday morning, the government that
OL,11,Fcontrols eastern Libya said there had
OL,12,Fbeen an explosion on the warship at the
OL,13,FBenghazi naval base, while it was
OL,14,Fdocking for fuel and supplies ahead of
OL,15,Fits return to Russia.
OL,17,FZelensky said the attack hit a second
OL,18,FRussian vessel, a cargo ship which he
OL,19,Fclaimed was being used to transport
OL,20,Fweapons.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
